  "description": "A hardcore tactical extraction shooter where survival is everything.\n\nEnter a dangerous warzone inspired by intense extraction-based FPS gameplay. In Escape From DUCKNESS, every raid is high risk and high reward. Fight armed enemies, secure valuable loot, and extract before you lose it all.\n\nThis is not an arcade shooter. This is tactical survival.\n\nPlan your loadout carefully. Choose the right weapons, armor, and equipment for each mission. Every bullet matters. Every sound can reveal your position. Smart movement, positioning, and timing are the keys to survival.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Hardcore extraction shooter gameplay\n• Tactical FPS combat with realistic gunplay\n• High-risk raids with permanent loot loss\n• Weapon customization and strategic loadouts\n• Intense PvE firefights\n• Immersive survival mechanics\n• Loot, extract, upgrade, repeat\n\nExplore hostile maps filled with ambush points, hidden gear, and unpredictable threats. Engage in close-quarters battles or long-range tactical encounters. Adapt your strategy every raid.\n\nIf you die, you lose your gear.\nIf you extract, you grow stronger.\n\nDesigned for players who enjoy realistic shooters, survival combat, and high-tension gameplay, Escape From DUCKNESS delivers adrenaline-filled missions where every decision counts.\n\nGear up. Enter the raid. Secure the loot. Escape alive.",
